WEBVTT

00:00:12.697 --> 00:00:14.350
You...

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.135
You're the Heir of Slytherin.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.705
You're Voldemort.

00:00:20.705 --> 00:00:23.011
Surely you didn't think

00:00:23.011 --> 00:00:27.494
I was going to keep
my filthy Muggle father's name?

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:30.279
No.
I fashioned myself a new name...

00:00:30.279 --> 00:00:32.978
a name I knew wizards everywhere
would one day fear to speak

00:00:32.978 --> 00:00:35.850
when I became the greatest
sorcerer in the world.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.373
Albus Dumbledore

00:00:37.373 --> 00:00:39.724
is the greatest sorcerer
in the world.

00:00:39.724 --> 00:00:41.639
Dumbledore's been driven
out of this castle

00:00:41.639 --> 00:00:43.249
by the mere memory of me.

00:00:43.249 --> 00:00:44.903
He'll never be gone,

00:00:44.903 --> 00:00:47.035
not as long as those who remain
are loyal to him.

00:00:50.038 --> 00:00:51.344
[BIRD CRYING]

00:00:51.344 --> 00:00:54.652
[♪♪♪]

00:00:54.652 --> 00:00:55.870
Fawkes?

00:01:12.191 --> 00:01:16.282
So this is what Dumbledore
sends his great defender?

00:01:16.282 --> 00:01:19.633
A songbird and an old hat.

00:01:21.896 --> 00:01:25.987
[SPEAKS PARSELTONGUE]

00:01:32.907 --> 00:01:35.910
Let's match the power
of Lord Voldemort,

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:37.782
Heir of Salazar Slytherin,

00:01:37.782 --> 00:01:40.785
against the famous Harry Potter.

00:01:40.785 --> 00:01:43.135
[SNARLING]

00:01:44.484 --> 00:01:46.312
[BASILISK SHRIEKS & GROWLS]

00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:54.929
[SPEAKS PARSELTONGUE]

00:01:54.929 --> 00:01:56.888
Parseltongue won't
save you now, Potter.

00:01:56.888 --> 00:01:58.542
It only obeys me.

00:02:13.861 --> 00:02:15.733
[FAWKES CRIES]

00:02:29.485 --> 00:02:31.270
No!

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:34.012
Your bird
may have blinded the basilisk,

00:02:34.012 --> 00:02:35.883
but it can still hear you.

00:03:36.901 --> 00:03:38.990
[ROCK CLATTERS TO A STOP]

00:04:17.855 --> 00:04:19.857
Yes, Potter.

00:04:19.857 --> 00:04:21.380
The process
is nearly complete.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.599
In a few minutes,
Ginny Weasley will be dead,

00:04:23.599 --> 00:04:25.558
and I will cease to be a memory.

00:04:25.558 --> 00:04:29.127
Lord Voldemort
will return...

00:04:29.127 --> 00:04:33.697
very...much...alive.

00:04:33.697 --> 00:04:35.568
Ginny...

00:04:36.743 --> 00:04:38.353
[ROARS]

